/-!
# Inverse-adjoint coordinates of the graph image words

The displayed inverse matrices and rational-action numerators are numerical
certificates for the actual signed words in `Words`. The source action is
inverse adjoint, in the fixed quaternion coordinates of `Block.Realization`.
`ConjugationChecks` checks all identities before they are used. Numerical
provenance: John Bray, ATLAS 6L34G1-Ar6aB0; see `Graph.Data`.
-/

